OL,3,GNEWSABridges, fox and rally car star in
OL,4,Aexhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoxes, bridges and a rally car are
OL,7,Famong the subjects set to star in a
OL,8,Fphotography club's annual exhibition.
OL,10,FLow Barns Photography Group is
OL,11,Fpreparing for its fourth yearly show of
OL,12,Fimages taken across the north-east of
OL,13,FEngland and Cumbria at Low Barns Nature
OL,14,FReserve in Witton-le-Wear, near Bishop
OL,15,FAuckland.
OL,17,FThe free display will run from 29
OL,18,FAugust to 2 September at the site's
OL,19,FAlder Room, which is open daily from
OL,20,F10:00 to 16:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
